ENGLISH.update({'三网自动适配': 'Automatic carrier setup', 'Q10 · Q20 · Passport': 'Q10 · Q20 · Passport', '首次安装后，换卡并正常重启即可在手机上选择运营商。\n支持当前验证范围：SQN100-3、SQC100-2、SQW100-4 / OS 10.3.3.3216。\n移动 460-00、联通 460-01、电信 460-11；其他 SIM 类型待适配。\nPassport 切换电信入网策略时可能需要再重启一次。': 'After installation, change SIM and restart normally to select the carrier on the phone.\nCurrent scope: SQN100-3, SQC100-2, SQW100-4 / OS 10.3.3.3216.\nMobile 460-00, Unicom 460-01, Telecom 460-11; other SIM routes need adaptation.\nPassport may need one additional restart when changing Telecom attach policy.', '请连接已完成 Root 的手机。新统一版本仍需实机换卡验收。': 'Connect a rooted phone. This unified candidate still needs hardware SIM-switch acceptance.', '检查设备': 'Check device', '备份并安装自动适配': 'Back up and install', '刷新状态': 'Refresh status', '停用自动适配': 'Disable automatic setup', '正在处理，请保持 USB 连接，暂勿换卡或拨打电话。': 'Working. Keep USB connected; do not change SIM or place calls yet.', '操作未完成。请保持当前状态，重新检查设备。': 'The operation did not complete. Preserve the current state and check the device again.', 'SIM 未就绪': 'SIM not ready', '原始配置已备份，自动适配已安装。请用手机电源菜单正常重启，再刷新状态。': 'Original settings are backed up and automatic setup is installed. Restart normally from the phone power menu, then refresh status.', '已关闭自动启动。请等待恢复完成，再正常重启。': 'Automatic startup is disabled. Wait for restoration, then restart normally.', '等待状态更新': 'Waiting for status', '等待 SIM 就绪': 'Waiting for SIM readiness', '等待 SIM 和正常 LTE 数据服务': 'Waiting for SIM and normal LTE data service', '正在注册 IMS': 'Registering IMS', 'IMS 已连接，请验收双向通话': 'IMS connected. Verify incoming and outgoing calls.', '请使用手机电源菜单正常重启': 'Restart normally from the phone power menu.', '运营商入网策略已保存，请再正常重启一次': 'Carrier attach policy saved. Restart normally once more.', '等待开机服务启动': 'Waiting for the startup service', '适配未完成，请保留现场并导出报告': 'Setup is incomplete. Preserve the state and export a report.', '服务已停止': 'Service stopped', '原生 IMS 已退出，请正常重启': 'Native IMS exited. Restart normally.', '安装会保存原始配置并接替现有适配。首次安装及后续换卡需要正常重启。': 'Installation saves the originals and takes over the existing adapter. Restart normally after installation and after changing SIM.', '电脑备份位置：': 'Desktop backup: ', '原始备份和旧版本文件仍保留，可用于恢复。': 'Original backups and previous version files are retained for recovery.', 'IMS 注册：{}\n无线网络：{}\n运营商：{}': 'IMS registration: {}\nRadio network: {}\nCarrier: {}'})

ENGLISH.update({'重启后由手机识别当前 SIM，无需再次连接电脑。': 'After restart, the phone selects the current SIM without reconnecting to a computer.', '已启用自动适配，请正常重启。': 'Automatic setup enabled. Restart the phone normally.', '三网自动适配文件及原始备份回执已核验。': 'Automatic carrier files and the original backup receipt are verified.', '本次开机自动选择的运营商已注册；双向通话仍需实机确认。': 'The carrier selected during this boot is registered; incoming and outgoing calls still need testing.', '自动适配尚未完成注册。首次安装或换卡后请正常重启，再查看状态。': 'Automatic setup has not registered yet. Restart normally after installation or a SIM change, then check status.', '手机已安装三网自动适配。请使用“三网自动适配”管理现有服务。': 'Automatic carrier setup is installed. Use Automatic carrier setup to manage it.', '手机自动适配版本与程序不匹配。请保留当前安装并导出报告。': 'The phone payload does not match this app. Preserve the installation and export a report.', '当前 SIM 不在支持范围内，未启动自动适配': 'This SIM is outside the supported scope. Automatic setup has not started.', '换卡并正常重启后由手机选择运营商，无需再次连接电脑。管理和恢复请使用“三网自动适配”。': 'Change SIM and restart normally; the phone selects its carrier without a computer. Use Automatic carrier setup for management and recovery.', '三网自动适配已安装': 'Automatic carrier setup installed', '启用自动适配': 'Enable automatic setup', '将停用自动适配并恢复其配置，恢复后请正常重启。': 'Automatic setup will be disabled and its settings restored. Restart normally after restoration.', '将启用自动适配；请正常重启，由手机识别当前 SIM。': 'Automatic setup will be enabled. Restart normally to select the current SIM on the phone.', '三网自动适配 · 实机验收版': 'Automatic carrier setup / hardware acceptance candidate'})

